# The buyers: Benny Ruiz, who knows who's buying - a booth at the back of a
# steakhouse on the Tamiami Trail. (Fiction.) Reads and acts through
# Talk.State: can_sell(buyer, good), quote_line(buyer, good), sell(buyer, good), corners_line().

~ start
if campaign_complete
	=> epilogue
if campaign_chapter == 1 and campaign_chapter > 0
	Benny Ruiz: I find the buyers. Manny finds the people. Get grass into a stash, then put a dealer to work.
if not trade
	Benny Ruiz: Nothing to sell in this game.
	=> END
Benny Ruiz: [[Sit down, sit down. Who are we selling to?|The phone's been ringing. Everybody's buying.|You look like a man holding product.]]
Benny Ruiz: We're holding {{coke}} lb of cocaine, {{weed}} lb of grass and {{rifles}} rifles. The street pays {{money_s(street_coke)}} a pound for cocaine, {{money_s(street_weed)}} for grass.
if not connected
	Benny Ruiz: The Colombians don't know us yet. Move another {{connect_left}} pounds of grass and they'll hear the name.
=> buyers

~ buyers
- Sell the Morettis {{quote_line("family", "cocaine")}} [if can_sell("family", "cocaine")]
	do sell("family", "cocaine")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	=> sold
- Sell the Morettis {{quote_line("family", "marijuana")}} [if can_sell("family", "marijuana")]
	do sell("family", "marijuana")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	=> sold
- Arm the Morettis' crews with {{quote_line("family", "guns")}} [if can_sell("family", "guns")]
	do sell("family", "guns")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	Benny Ruiz: They'll use them on Los Cuervos. That's not our problem. Is it?
	=> sold
- Sell the Company {{quote_line("agency", "cocaine")}} [if can_sell("agency", "cocaine")]
	do sell("agency", "cocaine")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	Benny Ruiz: It flies north on their planes. Somebody's corner gets flooded. Hope it's not ours.
	=> sold
- Send the Company {{quote_line("agency", "guns")}} for the war down south [if can_sell("agency", "guns")]
	do sell("agency", "guns")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	=> sold
- Sell Los Cuervos {{quote_line("rival", "guns")}} [if can_sell("rival", "guns")]
	do sell("rival", "guns")
	if result != ""
		Radio: {{result}}
		=> END
	Benny Ruiz: Money's money. Just remember which way those rifles point.
	=> sold
- Who can we sell to right now?
	Benny Ruiz: {{buyer_status()}}.
	=> buyers
- How are the corners?
	Benny Ruiz: {{corners_line()}}.
	=> buyers
- That's all for now.
	Benny Ruiz: [[You know where I eat.|Don't sell it all at once - you'll flood your own street.]]
	=> END

~ sold
if result != ""
	Benny Ruiz: {{result}}
else
	Benny Ruiz: {{trade_last}}.
=> buyers


~ epilogue
Benny Ruiz: 1989. You made enough to choose your next move. I remember when you came in asking whether grass would cover the fuel.
Benny Ruiz: {{campaign_ending}}
- Back to business.
	Benny Ruiz: Then sit down. The coast is still here, and the phone still rings.
	=> buyers
- Leave it there for now.
	Benny Ruiz: Take care of your people. They remember more than the money.
	=> END
